{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Ho, he who plots evil against his house</b> — after it comes the woe against Belshazzar. And thus you plotted evil against your house. This is the opinion of R. Moses the Kohen, and it is not only about the kingdom of Babylon, as he said: \"Babylon the Great, which I have built.\""], :book :habakkuk, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["<b>Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk</b>- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"] ["Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:10.027862937Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}